      "content": "no fever or anything, just the heavy chest and the fluttering. i feel okay when i'm just sitting on the couch but the stairs really kill me. i'm just really busy with work right now and dont really have time to go to a doctor or sit in a waiting room for hours. do u think it's just something like a vitamin deficiency or maybe i just need more electrolytes? like can i just try to rest it off for another week?",
