      "content": "i hear u but i really just want to try to fix it myself first if i can. i feel like i'm just overreacting and it's probably just my body being tired from the virus. if i take some high strength magnesium and maybe some extra electrolytes and just sleep more, do u think that would fix the heart thing? like is there a specific dose of something i should take to help my heart rhythm feel more steady while i recover?",
